 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>Az ilyen állványokat az étkezőasztal, vagy a bárpult mellé lehet állítani, így a pezsgőhűtő jégveder nem foglal helyet az asztalon.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\"><strong>Figyelemfelkeltő és látványos módja a pezsgős jégveder elhelyezésének </strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\"><strong>és a  champagne-ok szervírozásának.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\"><strong>Sárga színű szabadon álló pezsgős jégveder tartó állvány.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A teljes szerkezet fémből készül kézi gyártással.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A sárga színű pezsgő állvány magassága: 205 cm.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Custom-made champagne bucket holder made to order.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It can be placed next to the dining table or bar counter so the large magnum champagne cooler ice bucket does not take up space on the table.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s an eye-catching way to serve champagne.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Wine Bucket Stand, Steel Ice Bucket Stand Only, Free Standing Champagne Bucket Stand, Heavy Duty Wine Chiller Bucket Stand for Party</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\"><strong>Yellow coloured free standing champagne ice bucket holder.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The whole structure is handmade of metal.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Height of the yellow champagne stand: 205 cm.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-8 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Banquet, Events, Steel Champagne bucket holder, Outdoor Party, Bottle cooler holder, Floor Standing Metal Stand, Stand for wine or champagne bowl</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-9 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-10 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Nézze meg a <a href=\"https://champagneclub.hu/category/sursum-vivere/\"><strong>Sursum Vivere Kft. többi pezsgőzéssel kapcsolatos egyedi bárfelszerelését és champagne ajándéktárgyait &gt;&gt;&gt;</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-11 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-larger-font-size\">Check out the rest of <a href=\"https://champagneclub.hu/category/sursum-vivere/\"><strong>Sursum Vivere Ltd&#8217;s unique champagne barware and champagne souvenirs &gt;&gt;&gt;</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-12 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\"><strong>Ha szeretné champagne gyűjteményét megfelelő körülmények között tárolni és bemutatni, akkor kérjen ajánlatot tőlünk.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\"><strong>A kisebb mini pupitre-ktől kezdve a temperált bor és pezsgőtároló szobákig készek vagyunk megoldást nyújtani palackos kollekcióinak szakszerű tárolásához.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you want to store and display your champagne collection in optimal conditions, request a quote from us.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>From smaller mini pupitres to temperature-controlled wine and champagne storage rooms, we are ready to provide solutions for the professional storage of your bottle collections.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-regular-font-size\"><strong>www.sursumvivere.hu</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-13 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-14 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
